WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:05.645
Sanjay was in the kitchen when his sister, Priya, ran by.

2
00:00:05.646 --> 00:00:12.253
She had a bundle of markers and several pieces of cardboard.

3
00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:18.397
The next time she went by, she had a Betsy doll and a Space Man figure.

4
00:00:18.398 --> 00:00:21.979
"That's my Space Man!" Sanjay said.

5
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:27.983
"What are you doing, Priya?" He followed her into the family room.

6
00:00:27.984 --> 00:00:32.121
"I was watching videos on the Internet," Priya said.

7
00:00:32.122 --> 00:00:37.304
"I saw a film that a kid made and decided to make one myself."

8
00:00:37.305 --> 00:00:43.169
Sanjay's eyes lit up. "You'll need actors! Can I be in your movie?"

9
00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.743
Priya shook her head. "I don't need actors.

10
00:00:46.744 --> 00:00:50.377
This is going to be a stop-motion animation."

11
00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:54.220
"Animation?" Sanjay asked.

12
00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:59.378
"I'm going to take lots of pictures of Betsy and Space Man.

13
00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:04.721
I'll move them a little between each picture," Priya explained.

14
00:01:04.722 --> 00:01:10.533
"When I put all the pictures together, it will look like they're moving! Want to help?"

15
00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:11.906
"Sure."

16
00:01:11.907 --> 00:01:17.621
Sanjay helped Priya color buildings on a piece of cardboard.

17
00:01:17.622 --> 00:01:21.027
"This will be the background," Priya said.

18
00:01:21.028 --> 00:01:24.028
"Betsy is going to chase Space Man."

19
00:01:24.029 --> 00:01:28.313
"Why is she going to chase him?" Sanjay asked.

20
00:01:28.314 --> 00:01:30.955
Priya shrugged.

21
00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:37.255
Sanjay laughed. "Priya, she needs to have a reason for chasing him.

22
00:01:37.256 --> 00:01:41.210
If she doesn't, the film won't be interesting.

23
00:01:41.211 --> 00:01:46.047
Let's come up with a story with a beginning, middle, and end."

24
00:01:46.048 --> 00:01:48.823
Priya and Sanjay thought.

25
00:01:48.824 --> 00:01:50.959
"Okay," Priya said.

26
00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.917
"Betsy puts down her favorite marker.

27
00:01:53.918 --> 00:01:58.434
When she isn't looking, it rolls away and Space Man finds it.

28
00:01:58.435 --> 00:02:01.178
He picks it up and—"

29
00:02:01.179 --> 00:02:08.344
"Betsy thinks he stole the marker," Sanjay added, "so she chases him!"

30
00:02:08.345 --> 00:02:11.183
Priya smiled. "Perfect!

31
00:02:11.184 --> 00:02:16.220
Then he falls down and she takes back the marker. The end!"

32
00:02:16.221 --> 00:02:20.669
Sanjay set up the cardboard background.

33
00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:24.428
He placed paper and a marker in front of Betsy.

34
00:02:24.429 --> 00:02:28.471
Priya got the camera ready.

35
00:02:28.472 --> 00:02:31.901
Priya took a picture of Betsy with the marker.

36
00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:36.550
Then Sanjay moved Betsy's hand, just a tiny bit.

37
00:02:36.551 --> 00:02:38.913
Priya took another picture.

38
00:02:38.914 --> 00:02:43.136
After a long time, they had a bunch of pictures.

39
00:02:43.137 --> 00:02:49.154
They uploaded the pictures to a filmmaking program on Priya's laptop.

40
00:02:49.155 --> 00:02:53.826
The program quickly showed all the pictures, one at a time.

41
00:02:53.827 --> 00:02:59.749
"Cool!" Sanjay said. "It looks like Betsy is drawing with the marker!"

42
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:04.682
Next they filmed the marker rolling away from Betsy.

43
00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:10.406
Then they took pictures of Space Man picking up the marker.

44
00:03:10.407 --> 00:03:14.795
"Now we film the big chase scene," Priya said.

45
00:03:14.796 --> 00:03:22.152
They spent all afternoon moving Betsy and Space Man tiny little bits at a time.

46
00:03:22.153 --> 00:03:25.596
They uploaded the rest of the pictures to the laptop.

47
00:03:25.597 --> 00:03:30.759
Sanjay and Priya recorded voices for Space Man and Betsy.

48
00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.304
Then they added some music.

49
00:03:33.305 --> 00:03:37.948
When they were finished, they showed the movie to their parents.

50
00:03:37.949 --> 00:03:42.382
"Let's upload this to the Internet," Priya said after the movie.

51
00:03:42.383 --> 00:03:49.962
Sanjay grinned. "Maybe it will inspire other kids to make movies too!"

